Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: parser.c
Line: 4224
Function: xmlParseAttValueInternal
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: When (buf.mem == NULL) and outFlags != NULL, the code decrements *attlen without checking if attlen is NULL. If the caller provided attlen == NULL (which the API allows), this results in a NULL pointer dereference at '*attlen -= 1;'.

